      "content": "Here are a couple of options for your script.\n\nThe **Reasonable Traditionalist** might say, \"Now, I love strong change, I really do, but you can't tear down the foundation to build a better house. We need to respect what built this community first, and only then can we make sure that the next generation has a strong, steady ground to stand on for the next fifty years to come.\"\n\nThe **Radical Progressive** could passionately state, \"Respect is a chain that binds us to the privilege of the powerful, and I won't be part of that comfortable, biased history you cling to. We are here to dismantle the whole, deeply entrenched system, because *right now*, the very ground you stand on is built on the subjugation of the most vulnerable in this state and beyond.\"",
